  "content": "<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/header/header.png\" alt=\"A Serilum Mod. Made with love. Lots of active mods for Fabric, Forge and Neo!\" width=\"838\" height=\"400\"></a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/members/serilum/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/curseforge.svg\" alt=\"CurseForge\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fSerilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/modrinth.svg\" alt=\"Modrinth\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://patreon.com/serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/patreon.svg\" alt=\"Patreon\" width=\"200\"></a> <a href=\"https://youtube.com/@serilum\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://workflow.serilum.com/badges/svg/youtube.svg\" alt=\"YouTube\" width=\"200\"></a></p>\n<h2><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/about-the-mod.svg\" alt=\"關於此模組\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:18px\">Compact Help Command 是一個修正遊戲內 `/help` 命令執行異常的模組。若無此模組，輸出將會是一份過長且未依字母排序的白色文字清單。當用戶安裝更多模組並使用該命令時，清單甚至可能超過可顯示的最大字數限制，造成資訊遺失。<br><br>加入此模組後，長串的命令將被分類排序並分页展示。您可透過 `<em>/help &lt;頁碼&gt;</em>` 瀏覽所有指令，且不同文字顏色能提升可讀性。您可在設定文件中調整顯示每頁的命令數量與顏色。下方範例圖片可見。<br><br>同時支援特定指令查詢功能：<em>/help &lt;指令&gt;</em>。</span></p>\n<h2><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/dependencies.svg\" alt=\"相依項目\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/collective\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/requires/collective.svg\" alt=\"需要 Collective\" width=\"251\" height=\"49\"></a><br><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/the-vanilla-experience\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/the-vanilla-experience.svg\" alt=\"包含於 The Vanilla Experience\" width=\"350\" height=\"49\"></a><a href=\"https://curseforge.com/minecraft/mc-mods/serilums-qol-bundle\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/dependencies/includes/qol-bundle.svg\" alt=\"包含於 Serilum&#x27;s QoL Bundle\" width=\"334\" height=\"49\"></a><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/environment/server.svg\" alt=\"環境：伺服器\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/configurable.svg\" alt \"可設定化\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252fconfiguration-guide\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/badges/configuration-guide.svg\" alt=\"設定指南\" width=\"220\" height=\"49\"></a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;<span style=\"font-size:18px\">所有可用設定選項：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\" style=\"margin-left:10px;padding-left:10px\">\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>addVerticalBarSpacing</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;&nbsp預設值 true</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">啟用後，在子命令的前後會添加空格。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>amountCommandsPerPage</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;預設值 8，最小值 1，最大值 50</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">玩家使用 /vote 指令時收到的訊息內容。</span><br><br></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:12px\"><em>下列設定行的可能色彩代碼值為：0:黑色、1:深藍、2:深綠、3:深青、4:深紅、5:深紫、6:金黃、7:灰色、8:深灰、9:藍色、10:綠色、11:青色、12:紅色、13:淺紫、14:黃色、15:白色。</em></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>commandColour</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;預設值 2，最小值 0，最大值 15</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">/help 中命令的文字顏色。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><strong>subcommandColour</strong></span><span style=\"font-size:12px;color:#8a8d91\">&nbsp;預設值 7，最小值 0，最大值 15</span><br><span style=\"font-size:13px\">/help 中子命令的文字顏色。</span></p>\n</div>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/showcase.svg\" alt=\"展示\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組作用前的有問題 <em>/help</em> 命令：</span></p>\n<div class=\"spoiler\">\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/compact-help-command/a.webp\" alt=\"\" width=\"666\" height=\"448\"></p>\n</div>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\">此模組將 <em>/help</em> 命令改為以下格式：</span></span><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/compact-help-command/b.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"461\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/compact-help-command/c.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"581\"><br><br></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/compact-help-command/d.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"1142\" height=\"434\"></p>\n<p><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">特定 <em>/help &lt;指令&gt;</em> 的內容：</span><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/projects/compact-help-command/e.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"854\" height=\"480\"></p>\n<h2><br><br><br><img src=\"https://cdn.serilum.com/description/nameplate/notes-n-links.svg\" alt \"注意事項與連結\" width=\"838\" height=\"64\"></h2>\n<p><span style=\"font-size:24px\"><strong>您可以自由將此模組用於任何整合包，但下載必須保留在 CurseForge 或 Modrinth 生態系統內。</strong></span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:18px\"><a style=\"font-size:18px;color:#008000\" href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fserilum.com%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Serilum.com</a> 提供所有可用模組的概覽和更多信息。</span><br><br><span style=\"font-size:14px\">由於難以維護各頁面評論，因此已關閉留言功能。</span><span style=\"font-size:14px\">如需反饋、意見建議或其他問題，請前往&nbsp;<a style=\"font-size:14px;color:#008000\" href=\"https://github.com/Serilum/.issue-tracker\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">Github repo</a>。感謝！</span><span style=\"font-size:6px\"><br><br></span></p>",
